  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "Xiaomi MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL (309B total, 15B active, fp8 attention with MXFP4 routed experts, MIT) on two Sparks with vLLM tensor parallel 2, the bundled DFlash drafter (7 tokens), FP8 KV, Marlin MoE, 300K context and text, image, video and audio input. Basis: tonyd2wild's recipe (MIT, measured, patched stock image with the three vLLM overlays baked in). Alternatives from other creators: MiaAI-Lab's SGLang kit (AGPL-3.0, EAGLE MTP or DFlash, 1M context) and r0b0tlab's SGLang kit on a self-quantized NVFP4 checkpoint (MIT, claimed +21 percent decode). Upstream throughput figures (about 45 tok/s single stream, 156 tok/s aggregate at six streams) are claims until measured here; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance is pending. Thinking default is chosen per request (chat template kwargs or sampling parameters), not as a recipe option; server default: Thinking off unless a request enables it (upstream default). Sampling defaults is chosen per request (chat template kwargs or sampling parameters), not as a recipe option; server default: Checkpoint generation config with repetition_penalty 1.05 (upstream default).",
    "tags": [
      "audio",
      "dflash",
      "mimo-v2.6",
      "multimodal",
      "mxfp4",
      "reasoning",
      "spark",
      "tool-use",
      "vllm",
      "video"
    ],
    "title": "MiMo V2.6 Flash RL vLLM two Sparks"
  },
