          "help": "BF16 KV at 0.85 memory utilization, as in the upstream BF16 baseline.",
          "label": "BF16",
          "value": "bf16"
        }
      ],
      "help": "Precision of the attention KV cache. FP8 gives a larger pool (upstream measured about 1.87M tokens at 300K context, six full-length requests); BF16 was measured at the same speed with a 560K-token pool.",
      "label": "KV cache precision",
      "name": "kv-cache"
    },
    {
      "choices": [
        {
          "default": true,
          "help": "Bundled DFlash drafter, 7 speculative tokens (upstream default).",
          "label": "DFlash 7 (default)",
          "value": "dflash"
        },
        {
          "env": {
            "VONK_MIMO_SPEC": "off"
          },
          "help": "No speculative decoding.",
          "label": "Off",
          "value": "off"
        }
      ],
      "help": "DFlash drafts 7 tokens per step using the bundled 2.9 GB drafter. Upstream measured it accepts about 5-7 of 7 on structured output and code, and about 1 on prose. Turn it off for plain decoding.",
